# Task tracker UI

Read `principle-experience-first` before changing layout or copy.

## Look

- One column, no card shell, no drop shadow, no border radius on the page.
- Ink, muted, and hairline borders. No green (or other) brand accent. Checkboxes use `accent-color: var(--ink)`.
- Filters are underlined text tabs, not pills.
- Add fields are underline inputs, not boxed inputs with a fill.
- Origin labels are small monospace text (`· Monday`), not bordered chips.
- Dark mode via `prefers-color-scheme` and the same token names in `:root`.

## Interaction

- Keep add, complete, delete, filter, items/subtasks, and week tags working. Restyle does not drop a control.
- Tap targets stay usable on a phone. Stack the task row on small screens; do not shrink delete/items into unreadably small pills.
- Empty states stay one short sentence.

## Where code lives

- Screen: `src/App.tsx`. Styles: `src/App.css` and `src/index.css`.
- Persistence and week math stay in `src/taskStore.ts`. Do not duplicate rollover or TTL in the UI.
